{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜10月23日  \" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261023.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】浸大發表大灣區薪酬調查報告，顯示香港企業今年的薪酬加幅為2.3%，較去年低，但預計明年回升至3.1%。究竟大灣區的職場市況如何？香港與內地城市各有何機遇？</p><p>周五的時事全方位，請來學者分析。</p><p>題目：大灣區薪酬與行業發展</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:02.659114+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:29:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T02:58:39.136580+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:35.249920+00:00","content_hash":"153229d2e281ec683b1415a7d18cd1713764688a371a515df9afcc213b6d8db6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}